l=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T08:04:32.089832+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1405,"images":15,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T07:43:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:59:33.028817+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T07:59:32.888151+00:00","content_hash":"3ade583ca157239046be73d57e6bcb61cd98bc345ec9173e69d99180a6f2324b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}